ing, down to $55.01, and the chart ends at $63.52.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakdown. The stock built what looked like a base, then broke out of the bottom instead of the top. There was never a breakout to buy. When a base gives way below, the move is to stay out, or get out fast if you bought early."}}